    "narrative": "The **Austin Waves** enter today\u2019s slate with **Gunnar Henderson** headlining the lineup as the clear top play, boasting an 81.87 efficiency score. His matchup against Tanner Bibee is ideal, as the combination of park factors and a significant boost from Bibee\u2019s slow delivery\u2014which optimizes **Gunnar Henderson**\u2019s elite stolen base potential\u2014provides a massive ceiling. Similarly, **Jackson Merrill** (75.26) and **Kyle Tucker** (74.26) represent high-leverage starts. **Jackson Merrill** benefits from a plush matchup against Riley Cornelio (5.59 xERA), while **Kyle Tucker** remains an auto-start despite facing a lefty in Nick Lodolo, as his pure output metrics continue to command an elite designation even in neutral platoon conditions.\n\nThe most difficult roster decision involved **Wade Meckler**, whose 47.03 score was the highest among the reserves. Ultimately, the optimizer bypassed **Wade Meckler** in favor of **Nasim Nunez** and **Dominic Smith** due to the specific need for defensive versatility and lineup structure, despite **Wade Meckler** holding a favorable park-adjusted profile. We are also tracking **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.66) closely; his high efficiency score against Gabriel Hughes is contingent on him holding the #3 spot. Any shift downward in the batting order would dampen his value, though his current platoon advantage against Hughes remains a primary driver of his strong projection.\n\nRisk management remains a priority today, as the majority of our lineup is reliant on pending official lineups. While we have projected **Liam Hicks**, **Drake Baldwin**, **Miguel Vargas**, and **Sam Antonacci** based on their usual spots, their scores\u2014ranging from 57 to 67\u2014are sensitive to order fluctuations. We are fortunate that the injury bug, which has claimed **Luis Robert Jr.**, **Andy Pages**, and **Jordan Westburg**, has not hampered our current active personnel. We will proceed with the designated starters, keeping a close eye on **Coby Mayo** (61.39); his score is bolstered by the environment against Bibee, but his negative platoon split requires careful monitoring should the game script shift early.",
